  "assumptions": [
    "Materials and dimensions are those of the S0 model card (integrations/openmc/risk_tests/rm_m_model_card.json); each is labelled published or authored there.",
    "The inboard build sits 6 cm closer to the machine axis than the published figure, because the published minor radius and the published radial build disagree (model card deviation D1).",
    "Iron stands in for Inconel 718 in the vacuum vessel and tank walls.",
    "Each TF coil is one homogenised solid of winding pack and case, not separate solids.",
